Tooling/prompts_zhtw_ref/

# Internal-only reference docs (handoff state, strategy, operator runbook)
docs/internal/

# Frozen external deliverables (proposal package, slide deck) — working
# tree retains them so the operator can re-open locally; git doesn't
# track new changes. See docs/archive/README.md for the two-lifecycle
# split (design/ tracked vs delivered/ ignored).
docs/archive/delivered/

# Operator discipline; loaded locally via Claude Code's CLAUDE.md walk, not tracked.

# xelatex / LaTeX 編譯副產物 (docs/*.tex 來源檔)
docs/*.aux
docs/*.log
docs/*.out
docs/*.toc
docs/*.synctex.gz

# Dated snapshots of benchmark problem dirs (local archive of "what was
# proved on date X"; framework-state files inside should never be
# committed per CLAUDE.md). Pattern: Problems/<name>_YYYYMMDD/.
Problems/*_2[0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9]/
# machine-local config: file-form env vars (task #13)
.env

# --- Problems/ artifact lifecycle (task #9, user call 2026-07-05) ---
# Tracked = the three HUMAN INPUT files (Manifest.md / Defs.lean /
# Root.lean). Everything generated is runtime state: proofs/ pairs with
# DB rows (resets/relabels churn it — was 571 modified + 17 deleted
# noise), TREE/BRIEF are regenerated views, LESSONS' knowledge lives in
# kb_entries, .drafts/.presearch are cross-spawn scratch. Proved
# EVIDENCE lives in Library/ (curated harvest) + Benchmarks/
# proved_manifest.jsonl; externally-valuable raw solutions should be
# harvested (library:true), not incidentally versioned.
# Enforced by tests/test_problems_tracking_hygiene.py.
Problems/**/proofs/
Problems/**/TREE.md
Problems/**/BRIEF.md
Problems/**/LESSONS.md
Problems/**/.drafts/
Problems/**/.presearch/
# generated classes swept into ea3dd4d/5da3c12 by broad pathspecs
# (2026-07-10): strategist plan, in-flight patch scratch, proposed-Defs
# draft, awaiting-human marker — all runtime state, same rule as above.
Problems/**/_plan.md
Problems/**/patch.lean
Problems/**/.proposed_Defs.lean
Problems/**/_OPERATOR_ATTENTION.md
# one-off strays untracked in the same sweep (left on disk, exact paths)
Problems/Geometry/stokes_theorem/stokes_theorem_reference.lean
Problems/Geometry/stokes_theorem/stokes_theorem_witnesses.lean
Problems/Topology/mayer_vietoris/Root (1).lean
Problems/residue_thm/Residue.lean

# e2e session logs (the *_run.log pattern above missed the _err twin).
*_err.log
.proposed_Manifest.md

# Paper pipeline bookshelf (docs/internal/paper_pipeline_design.md):
# originals + full-text extraction stay local (license + size); only
# the navigation map + meta are commit-eligible.
Papers/*/paper.*
Papers/*/text.md
Papers/*/.index_attempt/

# setup-stub transcript + live progress tap (regenerate every run)
installer/bootstrap.log
installer/setup-progress.log
installer/setup-done.marker
installer/setup-decisions.json
installer/setup-orchestrator.pid

# folder-local embedded Python (wizard fallback when no MSI lands)
.tools/
